WEBVTT

00:11.430 --> 00:13.430
- Prologue -

00:17.290 --> 00:21.080
I never would have imagined we had a
labyrinth hidden underneath the school.

00:21.080 --> 00:25.480
The treasure that I'm looking for is somewhere on the very bottom of this labyrinth.

00:25.480 --> 00:26.620
Be careful.

00:26.620 --> 00:29.420
We don't know when they might attack us.

00:29.420 --> 00:35.000
The Darkness Executives won't hesitate to kill us in order to protect the treasure.

00:52.320 --> 00:59.110
Presented By Refrain Subs!

01:02.820 --> 01:08.720
Since being alone was tough, the two of us held hands.

01:09.240 --> 01:15.220
The of us two were lonely, so we all stood in a circle and joined hands.

01:15.200 --> 01:23.430
I'm sure that's where we will gather our strength.

01:23.370 --> 01:28.430
Enough to stand up to any dream.

01:28.280 --> 01:31.060
Fly high towards the sky,

01:30.700 --> 01:35.220
Kick off the ground and send your voice to the heavens,

01:34.910 --> 01:40.270
Until you overcome those painful days.

01:40.030 --> 01:45.390
I'll never forget your voice, and I'll never forget your tears.

01:42.020 --> 01:42.060
The First Annual Make Kyousuke Chuckle Championships

01:45.030 --> 01:52.350
The future that we call "hope" begins now.

01:52.120 --> 02:03.140
Your feet will continue to step onward, even when the time of grief comes.

02:15.240 --> 02:15.960
Huh?

02:15.960 --> 02:17.340
What’s this?

02:17.340 --> 02:22.470
Behind one of these doors, there should be a staircase that will lead us down a floor.

02:22.750 --> 02:24.950
So, which one will you choose?

02:24.950 --> 02:27.460
If you choose the wrong one, we'll walk straight into a trap and die.

02:27.460 --> 02:28.600
I'll let you decide.

02:30.480 --> 02:31.680
What?! Me?

02:31.680 --> 02:33.950
Of course! Is there anyone else here to decide?

02:33.950 --> 02:35.360
No, but…

02:35.360 --> 02:39.330
You were able to survive all of my traps.

02:39.330 --> 02:41.330
You certainly <i>are</i> lucky like that.

02:41.330 --> 02:45.080
That was just by coincidence,
there's no way I can keep it up.

02:45.080 --> 02:46.560
There's no way <i>you</i> would die.

02:46.560 --> 02:49.520
That’s why I brought <i>you</i> here in the first place.

02:49.520 --> 02:50.830
There’s no way…

02:50.830 --> 02:52.380
Hurry up and decide!

02:54.170 --> 02:55.900
Guess I’ve got no choice…

03:06.280 --> 03:07.340
Riki-kun!

03:10.540 --> 03:11.950
Huh...

03:13.270 --> 03:14.740
Tokido-san?

03:14.740 --> 03:16.650
Keep your head down, idiot!

03:20.030 --> 03:22.450
Hurry up, do you plan on becoming a pancake?

03:32.360 --> 03:34.740
My intuition was completely off.

03:34.740 --> 03:36.250
But we didn't die, did we?

03:36.770 --> 03:38.920
That's not the problem—

03:41.510 --> 03:44.020
What's that sound?

03:45.200 --> 03:46.360
It smells like gas.

03:46.360 --> 03:48.470
There's a trap here too?

04:23.750 --> 04:27.060
One way or another, it seems we've made it all the way to the third level of the labyrinth.

04:27.060 --> 04:29.220
Just as I thought, you really <i>are</i> lucky.

04:29.220 --> 04:30.140
After all of that?!

04:30.140 --> 04:33.520
It goes to show, I made the right choice in bringing you here.

04:33.520 --> 04:36.140
Why are there even traps here in the first place?

04:36.140 --> 04:39.540
Who built this labyrinth and for what purpose?

04:39.540 --> 04:43.040
Who knows? I was never informed of such details.

04:43.940 --> 04:48.300
Spies are only given intel for what they need to know.

04:48.300 --> 04:50.830
There's always a chance of it falling into the enemy's hands.

04:50.830 --> 04:54.330
Even if I did know something, I wouldn’t be able to tell you.

04:55.580 --> 05:00.430
As a spy, I live in a very twisted world.

05:01.300 --> 05:04.830
There are times when we have to use our allies as pawns.

05:04.830 --> 05:07.850
And even times where we are forced to endanger our loved ones.

05:07.850 --> 05:10.810
If we're unable to do that,
then all that awaits us is death.

05:11.900 --> 05:14.220
Next up is the fourth level.

05:14.220 --> 05:16.390
It's only going to get tougher from here on out.

05:17.000 --> 05:20.100
One mistake and it will be all over for you.

05:21.110 --> 05:23.140
Prepare yourself for the worst.

05:30.020 --> 05:32.000
Yeah, yeah... I'm hungry!

05:32.000 --> 05:32.930
Something wrong with that?!

05:32.930 --> 05:35.180
Do you know how many sleepless nights I had trying to get here?

05:35.180 --> 05:38.370
Moreover, without having anything to eat or drink almost to the point of starvation.

05:38.370 --> 05:43.990
If it's going to be a long journey from here on,
wouldn't it be a good idea to get some food first?

05:44.440 --> 05:49.160
It'd be a shame if you were to collapse from starvation before getting to the treasure.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.890
That's true...

05:50.890 --> 05:53.410
Wait, why are you taking charge here?!

05:53.410 --> 05:55.410
I’m the one making decisions here!

05:55.410 --> 05:56.270
That's right!

05:56.270 --> 06:00.910
We need to prepare food and water to get ready for this long journey.

06:00.910 --> 06:04.500
After school tomorrow, we will go shopping for supplies before coming here.

06:04.500 --> 06:07.360
Make sure you show up on time, you hear me?

06:30.220 --> 06:32.640
This is such a peaceful sight.

06:33.290 --> 06:36.480
The underground labyrinth, the darkness executives...

06:36.480 --> 06:39.040
Those seem to be from an entirely different world.

06:40.790 --> 06:43.440
If she hadn't become a spy...

06:43.440 --> 06:47.710
I wonder if Tokido-san would have been able to smile like that?

07:10.460 --> 07:12.560
I'm going to head out for a bit.

07:12.880 --> 07:14.100
Huh?

07:14.100 --> 07:15.880
I might be home late tonight.

07:15.880 --> 07:16.880
What?

07:16.880 --> 07:18.100
Where will you be going, Riki?

07:18.100 --> 07:18.930
Eh?

07:18.930 --> 07:21.120
D-Does it really matter where I'm going?

07:21.120 --> 07:22.690
Hold it, Riki!

07:22.690 --> 07:25.800
Aren't you getting a little too excited over this?

07:25.800 --> 07:28.050
Excited? There's no way—

07:28.290 --> 07:29.620
Who are you going with?

07:29.620 --> 07:33.240
I was hoping I'd finally be able to get the chance to play with you!

07:33.240 --> 07:37.580
Why are you giving me the cold shoulder all of a sudden?

07:38.140 --> 07:39.060
Sorry, Masato.

07:39.060 --> 07:41.620
I'll be sure to play with you lots next time.

07:41.620 --> 07:43.720
W-Wait!

07:43.720 --> 07:45.060
Riki!

07:51.540 --> 07:52.880
She's certainly late.

07:52.880 --> 07:55.320
I've waited for a whole hour already.

07:55.320 --> 07:58.020
Don't tell me, Tokido-san was captured by—

08:13.860 --> 08:17.200
Yeah, yeah… I got this from falling asleep on my sleeve!

08:17.200 --> 08:19.160
I slept like a rock!

08:19.160 --> 08:20.880
Even though I told you not to be late.

08:20.880 --> 08:21.580
It's stupid, right?!

08:21.580 --> 08:22.140
Utter stupidity?!

08:22.140 --> 08:22.780
So stupid it's funny?!

08:22.780 --> 08:23.680
Go ahead and laugh!

08:28.520 --> 08:30.920
What?

08:31.050 --> 08:35.350
Don't tell me you didn't realize that?

08:35.350 --> 08:37.620
N-No, I didn't...

08:39.080 --> 08:40.370
I slept...

08:40.370 --> 08:43.180
Well, that's expected of a human.

08:43.180 --> 08:46.060
I'm supposed to be a spy,
but I still managed to be late.

08:46.060 --> 08:48.770
Leaving that aside, I'm just glad you're safe.

08:49.380 --> 08:52.150
I was getting worried and thought you might have been captured.

08:53.200 --> 08:55.440
You're finally starting to trust me...

08:55.440 --> 08:59.280
It would've been better if you just laughed, though.

09:03.750 --> 09:06.960
B-Being around you makes me lose my composure.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.270
Let's hurry up and get going.

09:17.360 --> 09:20.200
We should have enough water now.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.480
All that's left is to get the food.

09:30.340 --> 09:32.840
It's not like I was looking at it or anything.

09:33.780 --> 09:35.740
Are you interested in playing that crane game?

09:35.740 --> 09:36.740
Of course not.

09:36.740 --> 09:38.420
You can tell it’s a waste of time just by looking at it.

09:38.420 --> 09:40.460
Could it be that you've never tried this game before?

09:40.460 --> 09:42.060
I-It's not like I had a choice.

09:42.060 --> 09:44.870
I've been risking my life every day going on missions.

09:44.870 --> 09:47.410
I never had the free time to…

09:50.900 --> 09:53.120
Why don't you give it a try for a bit?

09:53.120 --> 09:53.840
Eh?

09:53.840 --> 09:56.050
You get to keep any stuffed animal you grab with the crane.

09:58.720 --> 10:01.140
W-Why would I possibly want a stuffed animal?

10:02.700 --> 10:04.840
I'm a spy, you know?

10:08.100 --> 10:09.040
Go!

10:09.040 --> 10:09.730
Keep going!

10:09.730 --> 10:10.700
That's it!

10:10.700 --> 10:13.150
I've got you now!

10:13.630 --> 10:14.180
Go!

10:13.890 --> 10:16.110
She's completely immersed in it.

10:14.190 --> 10:16.110
Keep going just like that!

10:17.950 --> 10:20.700
All right! I got it!

10:21.640 --> 10:22.990
This is too much fun!

10:22.990 --> 10:25.760
Is it fine for a spy to attract so much attention?

10:22.990 --> 10:25.760
I might be a master at this!

10:25.760 --> 10:28.100
Who's coming with me next?

10:28.100 --> 10:30.740
Riki-kun, which one do you want?

10:30.740 --> 10:32.630
W-Well, any of them is fine...

10:32.630 --> 10:33.960
No need to hold back.

10:33.960 --> 10:35.200
Just tell me which one you'd like.

10:35.200 --> 10:37.920
Okay... How about that phone strap in the front?

10:37.920 --> 10:39.920
Who cares about small stuff like that?

10:39.920 --> 10:43.110
Let's get the biggest stuffed animal in there!

10:43.110 --> 10:45.580
Then don't ask me in the first place...

10:48.830 --> 10:49.620
Okay...

10:49.620 --> 10:50.610
Come on...

10:50.610 --> 10:52.020
just like that...

10:52.020 --> 10:54.340
I can see some <i>interesting</i> things there...

10:52.480 --> 10:54.980
I did it! I did it!

10:56.320 --> 10:58.190
I must be a prodigy!

11:03.280 --> 11:05.580
This is all thanks to my excellent skills as a spy.

11:05.580 --> 11:08.290
I guess my training didn't go to waste.

11:08.290 --> 11:10.610
It came in handy, didn't it?

11:10.610 --> 11:12.080
All for this...

11:12.080 --> 11:12.630
Wait,

11:12.630 --> 11:18.340
why did I waste my abilities as a spy for this?!

11:20.250 --> 11:21.590
It's stupid, right?

11:21.590 --> 11:24.860
I was so immersed that I wouldn't have noticed if I were to be ambushed.

11:24.860 --> 11:26.240
Exposing myself like an idiot…

11:26.240 --> 11:27.120
Go ahead and laugh.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.120
Hurry up and laugh.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.980
Go "ahahaha".

11:31.460 --> 11:32.950
It's fine, isn't it?

11:32.950 --> 11:34.730
To have a break once in a while.

11:35.600 --> 11:37.140
Wait, what?

11:37.320 --> 11:39.280
Riki-kun, did you play too?

11:39.280 --> 11:42.150
W-Well, I only watched, but...

11:42.150 --> 11:45.160
So I was playing all by myself!

11:47.040 --> 11:49.140
I must say, I didn't expect that...

11:49.140 --> 11:50.200
Eh?

11:50.200 --> 11:53.540
I was having fun just by watching you.

11:55.340 --> 11:56.290
Really?

11:56.290 --> 11:57.540
Yep.

11:59.340 --> 12:00.800
Jeez...

12:00.800 --> 12:04.470
You really do disrupt my pace…

12:04.470 --> 12:08.310
At first I thought she was cold and conniving,

12:08.310 --> 12:11.400
but Tokido-san is really just...

12:19.790 --> 12:21.910
All right, preparations complete.

12:21.910 --> 12:24.610
Tonight, we'll reach the treasure for sure.

12:24.610 --> 12:26.590
Riki-kun, are you ready?

12:26.590 --> 12:27.960
Yeah, I'm all set.

12:27.960 --> 12:30.790
Oh? What a reassuring response.

12:34.210 --> 12:42.500
Before I realized, I came to enjoy getting dragged along by Tokido-san.

13:00.420 --> 13:05.070
Tokido-san is a lot more careless than she lets on.

13:06.130 --> 13:09.530
To the point where I feel like I must protect her.

13:10.340 --> 13:12.490
And I wonder...

13:13.290 --> 13:17.540
Why is it that I feel so nostalgic when I'm with her?

13:19.210 --> 13:24.960
I've definitely met her somewhere before.

13:26.420 --> 13:28.080
But where?

13:31.580 --> 13:32.970
A dead end?

13:33.140 --> 13:36.540
There should be a staircase hidden
somewhere that can take us further down.

13:38.440 --> 13:40.130
Let's look for it.

13:41.750 --> 13:44.110
What a strange pattern...

13:44.110 --> 13:46.690
Could it possibly be a hint?

13:46.690 --> 13:47.700
Riki-kun!

13:48.240 --> 13:49.060
They're here!

13:49.060 --> 13:49.890
It's them!

14:00.330 --> 14:03.420
You can't shoot, so keep looking for the stairs.

14:03.420 --> 14:04.590
I'll cover you!

14:04.590 --> 14:05.840
Got it!

14:14.040 --> 14:17.180
There's no doubt that there's
something more to these tiles.

14:17.180 --> 14:19.920
But it's too vague.

14:21.420 --> 14:22.150
What's this?

14:25.630 --> 14:27.030
I see.

14:27.030 --> 14:29.110
Which means...

14:38.450 --> 14:40.880
It's gotta be this one!

14:53.600 --> 14:55.560
I found it, Tokido-san!

14:58.480 --> 14:59.760
You go on ahead.

14:59.760 --> 15:01.100
I'll handle th—

15:03.940 --> 15:05.230
Tokido-san!

15:37.430 --> 15:39.160
There's more of them.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.520
This way, quickly!

15:54.790 --> 15:56.610
That was close.

15:56.610 --> 16:00.290
I don’t think they’ll be able to chase us this far, though.

16:00.290 --> 16:01.290
Are you hurt?

16:01.290 --> 16:03.950
Just a scratch, it's nothing.

16:03.950 --> 16:05.210
Thank goodness.

16:12.420 --> 16:15.510
I've never been this shaken up before.

16:16.300 --> 16:18.220
To think that I actually shot a gun.

16:19.790 --> 16:23.710
That was pretty good for your first time shooting.

16:25.040 --> 16:28.380
If you weren't there, by now I would've been...

16:31.400 --> 16:35.000
W-What? Is there something on my face?

16:37.420 --> 16:39.890
H-Hey! You laughed just now, didn't you?!

16:39.890 --> 16:41.160
I wasn't laughing.

16:41.160 --> 16:42.100
Yes, you were!

16:42.100 --> 16:43.370
S-Sorry.

16:43.370 --> 16:44.940
Sheesh.

16:44.940 --> 16:47.750
But what's with this steam?

16:47.750 --> 16:51.510
Yeah, I noticed it too.

16:58.380 --> 16:59.920
This is…!

17:01.820 --> 17:02.900
So that's what it was!

17:02.900 --> 17:06.870
There was data that this labyrinth has a place where hot water is stored.

17:06.870 --> 17:08.480
So it was here!

17:10.380 --> 17:12.340
This is perfect.

17:12.340 --> 17:15.450
If you weren't here, I could've
gotten in and washed myself up...

17:15.450 --> 17:18.250
It's fine, don't hold back.

17:18.250 --> 17:20.920
I'm sure you feel pretty gross like that.

17:20.920 --> 17:22.910
Yeah, but...

17:26.340 --> 17:29.960
I'll make sure it's safe to go in.

17:30.920 --> 17:33.300
Seems like it's safe.

17:33.300 --> 17:35.010
Looks like there's nothing wrong.

17:35.010 --> 17:36.990
Is it okay for me to go in?

17:36.990 --> 17:38.150
Go ahead!

17:43.430 --> 17:44.740
I won't look.

17:44.740 --> 17:45.410
You sure?

17:45.410 --> 17:46.560
I'm sure.

17:46.560 --> 17:48.670
Can I really trust you?

17:48.670 --> 17:51.260
I'll just be standing guard like this.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.780
It's a promise, then.

17:54.780 --> 17:56.290
I'll kill you if you look.

18:08.620 --> 18:10.920
This feels great.

18:10.920 --> 18:15.210
I never thought I would be able to relax in a place like this.

18:18.930 --> 18:21.460
The sky would normally be above us, wouldn't it?

18:21.460 --> 18:22.540
The sky?

18:22.540 --> 18:24.220
You mean like in an open-air bath?

18:24.220 --> 18:26.600
Yeah, like an open-air bath.

18:26.600 --> 18:29.040
Even if it’s just once, I’d like to get in one.

18:30.270 --> 18:33.440
But when will that dream come true?

18:33.440 --> 18:36.220
Taking a peaceful trip to the hot springs...

18:36.220 --> 18:39.250
That kind of life isn't fit for me.

18:40.380 --> 18:42.600
It would be wonderful, wouldn't it?

18:42.600 --> 18:45.290
If the starry sky were above us.

19:05.040 --> 19:06.950
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

19:07.560 --> 19:09.060
What do you mean, "no"?

19:09.060 --> 19:12.270
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

19:24.170 --> 19:26.330
I thought it was them.

19:26.540 --> 19:28.750
I-I also thought it was th—

19:28.750 --> 19:30.290
Don't worry, I didn't see anything!

19:30.290 --> 19:31.370
You're lying. You saw!

19:31.830 --> 19:33.840
I-I didn't see...

19:33.840 --> 19:35.130
that much.

19:35.130 --> 19:38.320
"That much"? What do you mean by that?!

19:38.320 --> 19:39.880
There’s no deep meaning behind it!

19:41.130 --> 19:44.840
L-Let's eat soon! You must be hungry, right?

19:47.220 --> 19:49.680
Tuna Salad

19:47.220 --> 19:49.680
Long Time Seller

19:47.220 --> 19:49.680
Assorted Sandwiches

19:47.220 --> 19:49.680
New Anpan

19:47.220 --> 19:49.680
Expiration Date XX.XX.XX

19:47.220 --> 19:49.680
Manufacturing Number ZY01

19:54.210 --> 19:55.500
Here, have some water.

19:55.500 --> 19:56.710
Thanks.

20:07.170 --> 20:08.870
It's like we're having a picnic...

20:09.960 --> 20:12.460
Isn't this kind of fun?

20:12.460 --> 20:13.380
Yeah.

20:13.380 --> 20:14.930
I sometimes think...

20:14.930 --> 20:18.380
that it'd be great if doing spy work like this was all just for pretend.

20:18.380 --> 20:19.710
Yeah, probably.

20:20.680 --> 20:26.140
But I have to go off to my next mission immediately after this one's over.

20:26.790 --> 20:28.350
Next mission?

20:28.350 --> 20:30.140
That's just how it is.

20:30.140 --> 20:34.980
Once this mission is over,
I won't be able to see you ever again.

20:37.000 --> 20:39.040
What is this feeling?

20:40.210 --> 20:43.500
I've had these same thoughts before.

20:44.380 --> 20:47.530
That I don't want to lose her.

20:52.790 --> 20:54.250
Saya-san?

21:01.880 --> 21:04.340
It just came out naturally.

21:04.960 --> 21:07.550
Saya-san...

21:07.960 --> 21:09.610
Riki-kun.

21:12.800 --> 21:15.520
We've met before, haven't we?

21:24.500 --> 21:27.320
Why are you crying?

21:27.320 --> 21:29.160
I'm not crying...

21:33.290 --> 21:36.120
I suddenly remembered.

21:37.600 --> 21:40.590
The feelings that lay deep inside my heart.

21:42.500 --> 21:46.160
That I had loved Saya-san...

21:48.150 --> 21:49.880
since long ago.

21:51.540 --> 21:54.720
While I ran around the bases,

21:51.870 --> 22:01.010
Episode 2

21:51.870 --> 22:01.010
The Two in the Labyrinth

21:55.020 --> 21:58.320
I suddenly stopped in my tracks

21:58.420 --> 22:05.240
To gaze at the ball that flew above my head.

22:05.310 --> 22:08.530
I wondered why

22:08.690 --> 22:11.920
I couldn’t even get that one hit,

22:12.160 --> 22:18.480
As I stood there bewildered.

22:18.780 --> 22:25.430
One point away, yet it feels so far.

22:20.540 --> 22:23.730
To the delicate eye.

22:25.610 --> 22:28.770
Don’t you feel that way too?

22:27.320 --> 22:30.730
Even if you feel like that.

22:29.120 --> 22:38.130
I wonder if I’ll be able to stand up to bat.

22:39.150 --> 22:41.970
But I know

22:42.020 --> 22:46.060
that my story from now on

22:46.090 --> 22:53.460
Is a journey for me to become as strong as you.

22:55.400 --> 23:00.130
This scene, where various ripples, forming and expanding,

22:59.730 --> 23:03.380
Are overlapping...

23:02.980 --> 23:10.120
You must not forget, these are everyone's feelings.

23:12.820 --> 23:16.620
As I look at you sitting next to me now

23:16.400 --> 23:25.610
You seem to be a little more mature.

23:31.030 --> 23:41.040
Episode 3

23:31.030 --> 23:41.040
Darkness Executives

23:32.090 --> 23:34.210
Right as we were about
to reach the treasure,

23:34.210 --> 23:35.950
the final obstacle appeared.

23:35.950 --> 23:37.030
Tokikaze Shun.

23:37.030 --> 23:38.160
Who exactly is he?

23:38.160 --> 23:41.040
Follow closely and don't complain!
